From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shphadnis <134159681+shphadnis@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 13:52:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] spectro: build ovirt-populator with Go 1.26.10

Red Hat now publishes ubi8 go-toolset 1.26.10 (1.26.10-1792672852,
amd64/arm64/ppc64le/s390x), so ovirt-populator no longer has to stay on
1.25.9 and builds with the same Go as every other forklift image. It keeps
the ubi8 builder: the base image is unchanged, only the toolchain moves.
---
 build/ovirt-populator/Containerfile            | 2 +-
 build/ovirt-populator/Containerfile-downstream | 2 +-
 build/ovirt-populator/Containerfile-upstream   | 2 +-
 3 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/build/ovirt-populator/Containerfile b/build/ovirt-populator/Containerfile
index 78ef9173e..5c86d0714 100644
--- a/build/ovirt-populator/Containerfile
+++ b/build/ovirt-populator/Containerfile
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-FROM registry.access.redhat.com/ubi8/go-toolset:1.25.9-1778589418 AS builder
+FROM registry.access.redhat.com/ubi8/go-toolset:1.26.10-1792672852 AS builder
 ENV GOPATH=$APP_ROOT
 WORKDIR /app
 COPY --chown=1001:0 ./ ./
diff --git a/build/ovirt-populator/Containerfile-downstream b/build/ovirt-populator/Containerfile-downstream
index acb7848e0..5f46469dd 100644
--- a/build/ovirt-populator/Containerfile-downstream
+++ b/build/ovirt-populator/Containerfile-downstream
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-FROM registry.redhat.io/ubi8/go-toolset:1.25.9-1778589418 AS builder
+FROM registry.redhat.io/ubi8/go-toolset:1.26.10-1792672852 AS builder
 USER 0
 ENV GOPATH=$APP_ROOT
 WORKDIR /app
diff --git a/build/ovirt-populator/Containerfile-upstream b/build/ovirt-populator/Containerfile-upstream
index 17ec48efa..f758e3294 100644
--- a/build/ovirt-populator/Containerfile-upstream
+++ b/build/ovirt-populator/Containerfile-upstream
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-FROM registry.access.redhat.com/ubi8/go-toolset:1.25.9-1778589418 AS builder
+FROM registry.access.redhat.com/ubi8/go-toolset:1.26.10-1792672852 AS builder
 ENV GOPATH=$APP_ROOT
 WORKDIR /app
 COPY --chown=1001:0 ./ ./
